  'O host aceita as mesmas props do SgToaster (aqui: richColors).': <String>['The host accepts the same props as SgToaster (here: richColors).', 'O host aceita as mesmas props do SgToaster (aqui: richColors).', 'El host acepta las mismas props que SgToaster (aquí: richColors).', 'Le host accepte les mêmes props que SgToaster (ici : richColors).'],
  'O host aceita as mesmas props do SgWhistler (aqui: rounded).': <String>['The host accepts the same props as SgWhistler (here: rounded).', 'O host aceita as mesmas props do SgWhistler (aqui: rounded).', 'El host acepta las mismas props que SgWhistler (aquí: rounded).', 'Le host accepte les mêmes props que SgWhistler (ici : rounded).'],
  'O host prevalece sobre o SgToaster solto': <String>['The host takes precedence over the standalone SgToaster', 'O host prevalece sobre o SgToaster solto', 'El host prevalece sobre el SgToaster suelto', 'Le host l\'emporte sur le SgToaster isolé'],
