  'toast(), success, info, warning, error, loading e promise. O toast loading nunca some sozinho.': <String>['toast(), success, info, warning, error, loading and promise. The loading toast never disappears on its own.', 'toast(), success, info, warning, error, loading e promise. O toast loading nunca desaparece sozinho.', 'toast(), success, info, warning, error, loading y promise. El toast loading nunca desaparece solo.', 'toast(), success, info, warning, error, loading et promise. Le toast loading ne disparaît jamais tout seul.'],
